{"id":"76488ff2-de4f-4e1a-a6c6-e2eadf49cfd4","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"3e014a54eec08ff7","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-runner.ts","baseline":{"blob":"40231a972e256848df34c8f3a73300e7b7467e35","start":800,"end":829},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","LAUNCH_WAIT_MS","=","60_000"]},"context":{"before":"02bcfdd730799c33","after":"bd16950aa5bf0083"}},"payload":{"text":"How long a run waits for the debugger to listen (a run typed as the editor starts): past it, the debugger couldn't\ntake it. The extension host's start can be slow on a first load, so a minute.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:53:59.801Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:53:59.801Z"}
{"id":"78915ccf-7437-4a92-bdd4-b3a2ee9f78f2","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a4eb2d27eddc588a","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-runner.ts","baseline":{"blob":"54ceecf10b0e19cce33bb581e98e28f15407ddd7","start":0,"end":46},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","Hub","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/hub","\""]},"context":{"after":"050e6545f79d2520"}},"payload":{"text":"Main-thread side of running programs: every run is a debug run (RUNNING.md) — `debug` launches one under the tsval\ndebug adapter (the ext host), its output, listening and exit on `node.out/listening/exit.<runId>`, its stdin\n`node.stdin.<runId>` — what's running, in one registry (runs.ts), and the dev servers: the dev-server worker\n(workers/node-worker.ts), started for the first one and never stopped, so stopping a run takes no server with it.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:54:04.026Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:54:04.026Z"}
{"id":"7900f467-37e3-45b6-9b43-fd34f0e0a754","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"7ea04e14c4d387b8","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-runner.ts","baseline":{"blob":"4c1c955348ab70810f30dbc386dc53d4cf9c840d","start":3131,"end":3202},"shape":{"type":"PropertySignature","atoms":["\"","onDevServerClosed","\"",":","(","port",":","number",",","handler",":","(",")","=>","void",")","=>","(",")","=>","void",";"]},"context":{"before":"d71d7491b609baa3","after":"bc6162273b3dda83"}},"payload":{"text":"When the dev server on `port` is dismissed from elsewhere: its last window closed. Returns an unsubscribe.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:53:35.723Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:53:35.723Z"}
{"id":"8958c276-df1e-4ec3-a187-d41676c9f0b5","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"5146050f12e3346d","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/node-runner.ts","baseline":{"blob":"49457558c40b04363b5a08332e93dd0dae8c87ed","start":2349,"end":2385},"shape":{"type":"PropertySignature","atoms":["\"","sendStdin","\"",":","(","data",":","string",")","=>","void",";"]},"context":{"before":"d03f70d069ff2d58","after":"48527ab5744b205c"}},"payload":{"text":"Feed a chunk to the running process's stdin (no-op when nothing is running).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:53:46.711Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:53:46.711Z"}
